---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Governide"
	description="A modern Astro website for personal projects, writing, and sharing ideas."
	pubDate={new Date('January 01 2024')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Hello! I’m the creator behind Governide. This site is built with Astro and designed to show off projects,
		blog posts, and the ideas I care about most.
	</p>

	<p>
		I enjoy building clean, performance-focused websites that are simple to navigate and easy to update.
		Whether I’m sharing work, writing technical notes, or describing the next steps for a project,
		Governide is the place where everything comes together.
	</p>

	<p>
		I’m currently focused on creating tools and content for modern web development, with an emphasis
		on clarity, speed, and strong design. If you'd like to connect, feel free to reach out at
		<a href="mailto:GOVERNIDE@GMAIL.COM">GOVERNIDE@GMAIL.COM</a>.
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li>Modern Astro-powered website</li>
		<li>Fast loading and responsive design</li>
		<li>Markdown/MDX blog support</li>
		<li>SEO-friendly metadata and sitemap generation</li>
	</ul>
</Layout>
